    "Append-only after PG-00D freeze (SC-11.2). v1.1.0 applies the kiro(terra) contract-review batch (1 P0 / 8 P1 / 3 P2) pre-freeze; see system-contract.md SC-11 change log.",
    "Schema fixtures: verdict accept/reject is judged against the referenced JSON Schema with additionalProperties:false semantics (fail closed), plus any extra_rules.",
    "State fixtures: the `sequence` must be a legal path in the referenced state machine; reject fixtures contain at least one illegal transition. Transitions' from/to may be lists (multi-source/multi-destination shorthand) and MUST be expanded.",
    "Cross fixtures: kind=cross entries carry {cut, capability} objects judged by the named rule only.",
    "Uniqueness constraints not expressible in JSON Schema are asserted via extra_rules.",
    "v1.1.1: closes kiro round-2 residuals (#6 terminal/resumable split, #7 duplicate-coverage fixture, #10 closing roster input, #12 exact private-set equality)."
  ],
  "extra_rule_catalog": {
    "logical_run_episode_unique": "SC-2.1: within one manifest, the canonical identity fields shared per-manifest (evaluation_batch_id, arm_id, seed) are constant, so (task_id, episode_id) must be unique across logical_runs.",
    "logical_run_id_unique": "SC-2.1: logical_run_id is part of the frozen six-field identity tuple and must be unique within one manifest.",
    "cut_receipts_cover_sealed_segments": "SC-3.4: evidence_commit_receipts must be 1:1 with sealed_segment_ids — no missing, no extra, no duplicate segment coverage.",
    "sink_receipt_matches": "SC-5.5: when sink_receipt is present, sink_id MUST equal required_sink_id and verified_digest MUST equal content_digest (mismatch reason: SINK_RECEIPT_MISMATCH).",
    "capability_scope_within_cut": "SC-1.3/SC-6.1: capability tenant must equal the cut's tenant and bound_private_spaces must be exactly the cut's frozen private Space set — same room_id, no duplicates, no missing, no extra."
  },
